WEBVTT

00:14:56.329 --> 00:15:00.954
final-five voting
is powerful and achievable.

00:15:01.996 --> 00:15:03.704
We now have proof.

00:15:03.746 --> 00:15:05.204
In 2017,

00:15:05.246 --> 00:15:08.079
I published my early work
on politics industry theory

00:15:08.121 --> 00:15:12.204
through Harvard Business School
with my coauthor Michael Porter.

00:15:12.246 --> 00:15:17.704
The report made its way to Alaska
where Scott Kendall read it,

00:15:17.746 --> 00:15:21.454
and then he took action.

00:15:21.496 --> 00:15:25.162
Scott used the work
to design a ballot initiative,

00:15:25.204 --> 00:15:27.621
including these new rules.

00:15:27.662 --> 00:15:31.412
Just last month, November 2020,